-- Run with JL4_LIBRARY_PATH naming `lib/` beside this file, whose `prelude.l4`
-- is not the copy compiled into `l4` (see it). Its calls are refused, as a
-- call into any module of the author's own is, rather than lowered as the
-- library's.
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `total` xs IS sum xs PLUS count xs
